  "captions": [
    {
      "t_ms": 0,
      "text": "Their C has the puck in our right corner. Our RD fights for it."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 1000,
      "text": "Our LD holds the front of our net. Our C has the slot."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 1500,
      "text": "Our LW is in the high slot, watching their RD at the other point."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 2000,
      "text": "Our RW stands between the puck and their LD at the point."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 2500,
      "text": "Their C passes to the point. Our RW is already in the lane."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3000,
      "text": "Their LD has it. Our RW is a stick length away."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4000,
      "text": "Their LD skates along the blue line. Our RW slides with them."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4200,
      "text": "Their LD shoots through a half-closed lane, low."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4500,
      "text": "Save. Our LD wins the rebound on the weak side."
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Fundamentals, the five jobs in our zone. Their C has the puck in our right corner. Our RD fights for it, our LD holds the front of our net, our C has the slot, our RW stands between the puck and their LD at the point, our LW watches their RD from the high slot. The pass goes to the point; the shot has to go through our RW."
